Template: bbb-record-ai-summary/transcription-backend
Type: select
Choices: openai_whisper, albert_whisper
Default: openai_whisper
Description: Transcription backend to activate
 Choose which transcription backend will be used as the active provider
 (installed as transcribe.rb). Both scripts are installed — you can
 switch later by running: dpkg-reconfigure bbb-record-ai-summary
 .
 openai_whisper: OpenAI Whisper API (requires OpenAI API key).
 albert_whisper: Albert API — French government LLM (requires Albert API key).
